  "description": "Three lines on the bottom boards, one in each lane. Each skater crosses the ice in three parts: glide in a low hockey stance and do a deep squat, do bubbles to the middle, then C-cuts to the top boards. The next skater goes when the one ahead reaches the middle. Come back down the outside of the lanes and join the back of your line.",
  "steps": [
    "Glide in your hockey stance, then squat down low and pop back up.",
    "Bubbles: push both skates out and pull them back together.",
    "C-cuts to the top boards.",
    "Next skater goes when you reach the middle.",
    "Come back down the outside and join the back of your line."
  ],
  "cues": [
    "Knees bent, chest up, stick on the ice.",
    "Push out, pull in, skates stay on the ice."
  ],
